#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:2
msgid "CMUcam2 Emulation"
msgstr "CMUcam2 仿真"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:4
msgid "The CMUcam2 has the following capabilities:"
msgstr "CMUcam2 具有以下功能："

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:6
msgid ""
"Track user defined color blobs at up to 50 frames per second (frame rate "
"depends on resolution and window size settings)"
msgstr "以最高每秒 50 帧跟踪用户定义的颜色斑块（帧率取决于分辨率和窗口大小设置）"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:8
msgid "Track motion using frame differencing at 26 frames per second"
msgstr "以每秒 26 帧使用帧差分跟踪运动"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:9
msgid "Find the centroid of any tracking data"
msgstr "查找任何跟踪数据的质心"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:10
msgid "Gather mean color and variance data"
msgstr "收集平均颜色和方差数据"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:11
msgid "Gather a 28 bin histogram of each color channel"
msgstr "收集每个颜色通道的 28 区间直方图"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:12
msgid "Process horizontally edge filtered images (not supported)"
msgstr "处理水平边缘滤波图像（不支持）"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:13
msgid "Transfer a real-time binary bitmap of the tracked pixels in an image"
msgstr "传输图像中被跟踪像素的实时二值位图"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:14
msgid "Arbitrary image windowing"
msgstr "任意图像窗口化"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:15
msgid "Image down sampling"
msgstr "图像降采样"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:16
msgid "Adjust the camera's image properties"
msgstr "调整相机的图像属性"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:17
msgid "Dump a raw image (single or multiple channels)"
msgstr "转储一幅原始图像（单通道或多通道）"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:18
msgid "Up to 176 x 255 resolution"
msgstr "最高 176 x 255 分辨率"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:19
msgid ""
"Supports baud rates of: 115,200 57,600 38,400 19,200 9,600 4,800 2,400 1,200"
" BPS"
msgstr "支持的波特率：115,200 57,600 38,400 19,200 9,600 4,800 2,400 1,200 BPS"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:21
msgid "Control 5 servo outputs"
msgstr "控制 5 个舵机输出"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:22
msgid ""
"Slave parallel image processing mode off of a single camera bus (not "
"supported)"
msgstr "基于单个相机总线的从属并行图像处理模式（不支持）"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:23
msgid "Automatically use servos to do two axis color tracking"
msgstr "自动使用舵机进行双轴颜色跟踪"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:24
msgid "B/W analog video output (PAL or NTSC, depending on camera module used)"
msgstr "黑白模拟视频输出（PAL 或 NTSC，取决于所使用的相机模块）"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:25
msgid "Flexible output packet customization"
msgstr "灵活的输出数据包定制"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:26
msgid "Power down mode"
msgstr "掉电模式"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:27
msgid "Multiple pass image processing on a buffered image"
msgstr "对缓冲图像进行多遍图像处理"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:30
msgid "Pre-compiled CMUcam2 Emulation Images"
msgstr "预编译的 CMUcam2 仿真映像"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:32
msgid ""
"A pre-compiled CMUcam2 emulation image is available: "
":download:`cmucam2_lpc2106-cmucam3.hex <dl/cmucam2_lpc2106-cmucam3.hex>` "
"(CMUcam2 already compiled hex file)."
msgstr ""
"提供了一个预编译的 CMUcam2 仿真映像： :download:`cmucam2_lpc2106-cmucam3.hex "
"<dl/cmucam2_lpc2106-cmucam3.hex>`\\ （CMUcam2 已编译的 hex 文件）。"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:36
msgid ""
"The per-baud-rate firmware images (115,200 / 57,600 / 38,400 / 19,200 / "
"9,600 / 4,800 / 2,400 / 1,200 / 300 8N1), the servo-reverse and servo-normal"
" images, and the ``cmucam2.c`` emulation source file were attached to this "
"page but were not preserved in the archive."
msgstr ""
"各波特率固件映像（115,200 / 57,600 / 38,400 / 19,200 / 9,600 / 4,800 / 2,400 / 1,200 "
"/ 300 8N1）、舵机反向和舵机正常映像，以及 ``cmucam2.c``\\ 仿真源文件曾附加到此页面，但未在存档中保留。"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:41
msgid ""
"There are several differences between the CMUcam2 emulation and the actual "
"CMUcam2. Below is a list of all CMUcam2 functionality with non-supported "
"features crossed off. Many crossed off features will be supported in the "
"near future."
msgstr ""
"CMUcam2 仿真与实际的 CMUcam2 之间有几处差异。下面是所有 CMUcam2 "
"功能的列表，其中不支持的功能被划掉。许多被划掉的功能将在不久的将来得到支持。"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:45
msgid "BM Buffer Mode"
msgstr "BM 缓冲模式"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:46
msgid "CR Camera Register"
msgstr "CR 相机寄存器"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:47
msgid "CP Camera Power"
msgstr "CP 相机电源"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:48
msgid "DC Difference Channel"
msgstr "DC 差分通道"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:49
msgid "DS Down Sample"
msgstr "DS 降采样"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:50
msgid "FD Frame Difference"
msgstr "FD 帧差分"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:51
msgid "FS Frame Stream (added r553)"
msgstr "FS 帧流（在 r553 中添加）"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:52
msgid "GB Get Button"
msgstr "GB 获取按钮"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:53
msgid "GH Get Histogram"
msgstr "GH 获取直方图"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:54
msgid "GI Get Aux IO inputs"
msgstr "GI 获取 Aux IO 输入"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:55
msgid "GM Get Mean"
msgstr "GM 获取均值"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:56
msgid "GS Get Servo Positions"
msgstr "GS 获取舵机位置"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:57
msgid "GT Get Tracking Parameters"
msgstr "GT 获取跟踪参数"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:58
msgid "GV Get Version"
msgstr "GV 获取版本"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:59
msgid "GW Get Window"
msgstr "GW 获取窗口"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:60
msgid "HC Historgram Configure"
msgstr "HC 直方图配置"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:61
msgid "HD High Resolution Difference"
msgstr "HD 高分辨率差分"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:62
msgid "HR Hi-Res Mode"
msgstr "HR 高分辨率模式"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:63
msgid "HT Set Histogram Track (not supported)"
msgstr "HT 设置直方图跟踪（不支持）"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:64
msgid "L0 Led Control"
msgstr "L0 LED 控制"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:65
msgid "LF Load Frame to Difference"
msgstr "LF 加载帧以进行差分"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:66
msgid "*LM Line Mode*"
msgstr "*LM 行模式*"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:67
msgid "MD Mask Difference (not supported)"
msgstr "MD 掩码差分（不支持）"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:68
msgid "NF Noise Filter"
msgstr "NF 噪声过滤器"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:69
msgid "OM Output Packet Mask"
msgstr "OM 输出数据包掩码"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:70
msgid "PD Pixel Difference (not supported)"
msgstr "PD 像素差分（不支持）"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:71
msgid "PF Packet Filter"
msgstr "PF 数据包过滤器"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:72
msgid "PM Poll Mode"
msgstr "PM 轮询模式"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:73
msgid "RF Read Frame into Buffer"
msgstr "RF 将帧读入缓冲区"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:74
msgid "RM Raw Mode"
msgstr "RM 原始模式"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:75
msgid "RS Reset"
msgstr "RS 复位"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:76
msgid "SF Send Frame"
msgstr "SF 发送帧"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:77
msgid "SM Servo Mask"
msgstr "SM 舵机掩码"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:78
msgid "SO Servo Output"
msgstr "SO 舵机输出"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:79
msgid "SP Servo Parameters"
msgstr "SP 舵机参数"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:80
msgid "ST Set Track Command"
msgstr "ST 设置跟踪命令"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:81
msgid "SV Servo Position"
msgstr "SV 舵机位置"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:82
msgid "TC Track Color"
msgstr "TC 跟踪颜色"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:83
msgid "TI Track Inverted"
msgstr "TI 反转跟踪"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:84
msgid "TW Track Window"
msgstr "TW 跟踪窗口"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:85
msgid "UD Upload Difference buffer (not supported)"
msgstr "UD 上传差分缓冲区（不支持）"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:86
msgid "VW Virtual Window"
msgstr "VW 虚拟窗口"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:88
msgid "**The following commands will not be supported in the near future:**"
msgstr "**以下命令在不久的将来将不再受支持：**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:90
msgid "CT Set Camera Type"
msgstr "CT 设置相机类型"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:91
msgid "DM Delay Mode"
msgstr "DM 延迟模式"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:92
msgid "L1 Led Control (look at SO instead)"
msgstr "L1 LED 控制（请改看 SO）"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:93
msgid "PS Packet Skip"
msgstr "PS 数据包跳过"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:94
msgid "SD Sleep Deeply"
msgstr "SD 深度睡眠"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:95
msgid "SL Sleep Command"
msgstr "SL 睡眠命令"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:98
msgid "CMUcam2 Emulation Differences"
msgstr "CMUcam2 仿真差异"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:100
msgid "**Servo Input Range**"
msgstr "**舵机输入范围**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:102
msgid "Servos are now 0-255 8-bit values"
msgstr "舵机现在是 0-255 的 8 位值"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:104
msgid "**Jumpers**"
msgstr "**跳线**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:106
msgid ""
"Due to the lack of jumpers on the CMUcam3, baud rate and servo direction "
"changes need to be done at compile time - these are controlled by #defines "
"at the top of the cmucam.c source code"
msgstr "由于 CMUcam3 上缺少跳线，波特率和舵机方向的更改需要在编译时完成——这些由 cmucam.c 源代码顶部的 #define 控制"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:110
msgid "**Set Input (SI** *pin* **) Command**"
msgstr "**设置输入 (SI** *pin* **) 命令**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:112
msgid "Sets the *pin* to be an input"
msgstr "将 *pin* 设置为输入"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:114
msgid "**Software Color Space (CS** *value* **) Command**"
msgstr "**软件颜色空间 (CS** *value* **) 命令**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:116
msgid "CS 0 sets the color space to the hardware default (RGB or YCrCb)"
msgstr "CS 0 将颜色空间设置为硬件默认值（RGB 或 YCrCb）"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:117
msgid "CS 1 does a software conversion to the HSV color space"
msgstr "CS 1 执行到 HSV 颜色空间的软件转换"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:119
msgid "Conversion assumes hardware is set to RGB for correct results"
msgstr "转换假定硬件已设置为 RGB 才能获得正确结果"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:120
msgid ""
"HSV space is an integer space where all values are scaled between 16 and 240"
msgstr "HSV 空间是一个整数空间，其中所有值都被缩放到 16 到 240 之间"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:122
msgid "Note: This is only available in r504 and higher"
msgstr "注意：这仅在 r504 及更高版本中可用"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:124
msgid "**Set Output can control the Blue and Orange LEDs**"
msgstr "**设置输出可以控制蓝色和橙色 LED**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:126
msgid "Servos 2 and 3 will stop working"
msgstr "舵机 2 和 3 将停止工作"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:127
msgid "SO 2 1 -> Blue on"
msgstr "SO 2 1 -> 蓝色亮起"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:128
msgid "SO 2 0 -> Blue off"
msgstr "SO 2 0 -> 蓝色熄灭"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:129
msgid "SO 3 1 -> Orange on"
msgstr "SO 3 1 -> 橙色亮起"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:130
msgid "SO 3 0 -> Orange off"
msgstr "SO 3 0 -> 橙色熄灭"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:132
msgid "**No Slave Mode**"
msgstr "**无从属模式**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:134
msgid "It is possible, but we currently don't support it"
msgstr "这是可能的，但我们目前不支持它"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:136
msgid "**Output Mask (OM)**"
msgstr "**输出掩码 (OM)**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:138
msgid "Only supports T and S packets (type 0 and 1)"
msgstr "仅支持 T 和 S 数据包（类型 0 和 1）"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:140
msgid "**Line Mode (LM)**"
msgstr "**行模式 (LM)**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:142
msgid "Only supports track color mode (LM 0 1)"
msgstr "仅支持跟踪颜色模式 (LM 0 1)"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:143
msgid "Track color statistics added in r523 (LM 0 2)"
msgstr "在 r523 中添加的跟踪颜色统计 (LM 0 2)"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:145
msgid "**Send JPEG (SJ)**"
msgstr "**发送 JPEG (SJ)**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:147
msgid "Sends a jpeg compressed frame, header and all"
msgstr "发送一个 jpeg 压缩帧，包括头部和所有内容"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:149
msgid "**Demo Mode**"
msgstr "**演示模式**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:151
msgid ""
"Since holding down the programming button puts the CMUcam3 into programming "
"mode, you need to press the button half a second after startup to enter demo"
" mode"
msgstr "由于按住编程按钮会使 CMUcam3 进入编程模式，您需要在启动后半秒钟按下按钮以进入演示模式"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:155
msgid "**Hi-Res Frame Difference**"
msgstr "**高分辨率帧差分**"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/cmucam2-emulation.rst:157
msgid ""
"This now works the same as low-res frame differencing, just at a higher "
"resolution"
msgstr "现在这与低分辨率帧差分的工作方式相同，只是分辨率更高"
